sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant API as Authenticated API
  participant UC as Farabi Query Use Case
  participant Policy as Policy Adapter
  participant Sem as Semantic Compiler
  participant DB as Query Repository
  participant Exec as Toba / Dremio Adapter
  User->>API: Request semantic query
  API->>API: Derive trusted actor/workspace
  API->>UC: Submit(request, actor)
  UC->>Policy: Authorize actor + assets
  Policy-->>UC: Allow / deny
  UC->>Sem: Compile validated semantic plan
  Sem-->>UC: Bounded query plan
  UC->>DB: Persist PENDING intent
  UC->>Exec: Submit compiled plan
  alt Provider confirms acceptance
    Exec-->>UC: Provider job ID
    UC->>DB: CAS SUBMITTED + provider ID
    UC-->>API: Execution ID and status
  else Ambiguous timeout
    Exec--xUC: Timeout / unknown acceptance
    Note over UC,DB: Keep intent for investigation; do not blindly resubmit
    UC-->>API: Indeterminate / retry guidance
  end
  API-->>User: Scoped response
